DOXA is currently under active development.

Current capabilities include:

- CSV upload
- Dataset profiling
- Semantic schema understanding
- Natural-language question handling
- Query planning
- Deterministic data analysis
- AI-powered explanation
- Dataset preview
- Investigation workflow

Future development will focus on:

- More analysis operations
- More complex multi-step investigations
- Better reasoning over multiple dimensions
- Improved evidence generation
- Better business recommendations
- Larger dataset support
- Production deployment
- Public access

