---

# 🧠 Project Vision

DOXA aims to move business intelligence from:

```text
"What happened?"
```

towards:

```text
"Why did it happen?"
"What evidence supports it?"
"What factors contributed to it?"
"What should I investigate next?"
```

The long-term goal is to make data investigation more accessible to people who may not know SQL, Python, or traditional BI tools.

